# The Key Tube on the tube's locked door (level $0F, object $3B,
# Obj_OpenableDoor, ps2.asm:7915, index $1B, cell 9,15). A on it is
# ObjType_Events $1B (loc_DC90): $170E. ItemAction_KeyTube (14360): the
# flag's bit 0 set, "{char} puts KEYTUBE inside." ($0018), demo 5 and the
# tube out of the bag. Demo_KeyUsed (5504) is seven idle reads and $FD:
# the door SFX and routine 2 into slot 0, which slides the door open over
# two frames of $F ticks and then clears its box.

start level $0F 9 18
wait screen level
wait idle
give KeyTube
walk up 2                    # 17, 16
wait step
press up                     # the door does not give
wait ticks 20
expect level $0F 9 16
press a
wait idle
expect script $170E
press c
wait idle
shot 01_shut
press c                      # ITEM
wait idle
press c                      # ROLF
wait idle
press c                      # the bag
wait idle
press down
press down
press down                   # KEYTUBE, slot 3
press c
wait idle
press c                      # USE
wait idle
expect script $0018
press c                      # the menu closes; demo 5 runs
wait idle
expect level $0F 9 16
wait ticks 20
shot 02_sliding
wait ticks 40
shot 03_open
walk up 3                    # 15 (the door's cell), 14, 13
wait step
expect level $0F 9 13
shot 04_through
expect no-stderr not ported
